    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/3d5584ff2134cce1d852cb2b427c1b19.webp?t=1750991872\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </strong>An action RPG with elements of metroidvania, sandbox and platformer. You will find a dangerous dungeon that transforms in real time and hides many secrets. Only by reaching its deepest depths will you uncover the truth about what this <i>&quot;dungeon&quot;\u00a0</i>really is...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/35916026334d181f67782f1096aeecea.webp?t=1750991872\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living dungeon \u2013 the world changes in real time, creating new challenges and opportunities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cartoon style graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full world destruction \u2013 almost everything can be broken\u2026 if you have a strong enough pickaxe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/70836f83aaf74bbe2c797a1ad52d5d22.poster.avif?t=1750991872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/70836f83aaf74bbe2c797a1ad52d5d22.webm?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/70836f83aaf74bbe2c797a1ad52d5d22.mp4?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building \u2013 construct structures, create battle cover, set traps, or carve new paths. It\u2019s all up to your playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/0b2e02ed3fea56e68514a87878bcff03.poster.avif?t=1750991872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/0b2e02ed3fea56e68514a87878bcff03.webm?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/0b2e02ed3fea56e68514a87878bcff03.mp4?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/4435dcb5f1908bc9f41b62af99fe39cd.poster.avif?t=1750991872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/4435dcb5f1908bc9f41b62af99fe39cd.webm?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/4435dcb5f1908bc9f41b62af99fe39cd.mp4?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle \u2013 combine skills, gear, and abilities to craft unique strategies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive objects \u2013  the world is filled with objects you can interact with in different ways</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs &amp; quests \u2013 meet interesting characters, complete quests, and shape the course of events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/3cf063b109efcde4e52f65a57c2576f7.poster.avif?t=1750991872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/3cf063b109efcde4e52f65a57c2576f7.webm?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/3cf063b109efcde4e52f65a57c2576f7.mp4?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/3d5584ff2134cce1d852cb2b427c1b19.webp?t=1750991872\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </strong>An action RPG with elements of metroidvania, sandbox and platformer. You will find a dangerous dungeon that transforms in real time and hides many secrets. Only by reaching its deepest depths will you uncover the truth about what this <i>&quot;dungeon&quot;\u00a0</i>really is...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/35916026334d181f67782f1096aeecea.webp?t=1750991872\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living dungeon \u2013 the world changes in real time, creating new challenges and opportunities</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cartoon style graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full world destruction \u2013 almost everything can be broken\u2026 if you have a strong enough pickaxe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/70836f83aaf74bbe2c797a1ad52d5d22.poster.avif?t=1750991872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/70836f83aaf74bbe2c797a1ad52d5d22.webm?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/70836f83aaf74bbe2c797a1ad52d5d22.mp4?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building \u2013 construct structures, create battle cover, set traps, or carve new paths. It\u2019s all up to your playstyle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/0b2e02ed3fea56e68514a87878bcff03.poster.avif?t=1750991872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/0b2e02ed3fea56e68514a87878bcff03.webm?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/0b2e02ed3fea56e68514a87878bcff03.mp4?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/4435dcb5f1908bc9f41b62af99fe39cd.poster.avif?t=1750991872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/4435dcb5f1908bc9f41b62af99fe39cd.webm?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2543920/extras/4435dcb5f1908bc9f41b62af99fe39cd.mp4?t=1750991872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your playstyle \u2013 combine skills, gear, and abilities to craft unique strategies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive objects \u2013  the world is filled with objects you can interact with in different ways</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs &amp; quests \u2013 meet interesting characters, complete quests, and shape the course of events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_